      "text": "A colleague drew the TAM study (H1: PEOU → PU, H2: PU → BI, H3: PEOU → BI) but the model will not run. Use the modeler's checks to find every problem and repair the model so that it matches the hypotheses. The questionnaire did not include attitude items."
